							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6085#msg6085"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6085#msg6085">Re:You've got to be kidding me...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> March 09, 2004, 09:08:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							OMG I really should run for President if stuff like this is happening. &nbsp;I just really think that the world is going to hell in a handbasket because we let stupid people run free makeing the rest of us sitting there going OMG OMG I cant believe this is happening. &nbsp;But hey we got to have someone to laugh at.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
