							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6455#msg6455"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=602.msg6455#msg6455">Re:You've got to be kidding me...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> March 24, 2004, 06:45:10 pm &#187;</span></td>
