							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<b>the nature of the honor roll is to recognize those academic achievers.</b><br />AND<b>Your daughter should win awards and recognition for her personality and sweetness, since that is what SHE excells at, not on the honor roll, which is about grades</b><br /><br />I did not say that I think my daughter should make the honor roll because she is sweet. <br /><br />(I was gonna say more but wait until I have calmed down)
